00:12:38.368 --> 00:12:39.335
I had no idea.

344
00:12:39.335 --> 00:12:41.140
So for sure, there is one reason.

345
00:12:41.140 --> 00:12:43.413
There were sailboats in the Cove,

346
00:12:43.413 --> 00:12:44.953
