419
00:15:24.593 --> 00:15:26.996
That's a cry for help is what that is.

420
00:15:26.996 --> 00:15:28.064
But nice job.

421
00:15:28.064 --> 00:15:29.233
You did it without a wetsuit.

422
00:15:29.233 --> 00:15:30.813
Thanks, man.

423
00:15:30.813 --> 00:15:32.559
I would have liked to have seen

424
00:15:32.559 --> 00:15:35.623
the starting position a little bit closer to.

